00:00:19.504 --> 00:00:21.773
EXPRESSING OUR SADNESS AND

00:00:20.905 --> 00:00:23.775
HEARTBREAK OVER THE DEADLY

00:00:21.906 --> 00:00:24.809
SHOOTING AT SANTA FE HIGH SCHOOL

00:00:23.908 --> 00:00:26.744
IN TEXAS.

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:27.779
THIS HAS BEEN GOING ON TOO LONG

00:00:26.878 --> 00:00:30.081
IN OUR COUNTRY.

00:00:27.912 --> 00:00:30.581
TOO MANY YEARS, TOO MANY DECADES

00:00:30.214 --> 00:00:31.883
NOW.

00:00:30.715 --> 00:00:33.584
WE GRIEVE FOR THE TERRIBLE LOSS

00:00:32.016 --> 00:00:35.286
OF LIFE AND TO SEND OUR SUPPORT

00:00:33.718 --> 00:00:39.090
AND LOVE TO EVERYONE AFFECTED BY

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:40.925
THIS ABSOLUTELY HORRIFIC ATTACK.

00:00:39.223 --> 00:00:43.094
&gt;&gt; Reporter: IN THE WAKE OF

00:00:41.058 --> 00:00:44.362
THE LAST MAJOR SCHOOL SHOOTING,

00:00:43.227 --> 00:00:46.030
MARJORY STONEMAN DOUGLAS HIGH

00:00:44.495 --> 00:00:47.198
AND FLORIDA, PRESIDENT TRUMP

00:00:46.164 --> 00:00:49.200
HELD MEETINGS WITH VICTIMS

00:00:47.331 --> 00:00:50.001
FAMILIES, GUN AND SCHOOL SAFETY

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:51.602
GROUPS.

00:00:50.134 --> 00:00:53.571
HE PROPOSED SEVERAL SAFETY

00:00:51.736 --> 00:00:55.440
REFORMS INCLUDING ARMY QUALIFIED

00:00:53.704 --> 00:00:56.674
TEACHERS AND SCHOOL STAFF BUT

00:00:55.573 --> 00:01:01.646
BACKED OFF THE CALL TO RAISE THE

00:00:56.808 --> 00:01:02.947
MINIMUM AGE TO BUY A RIFLE FROM

00:01:01.779 --> 00:01:03.614
18-21.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.616
TODAY PRESIDENT TRUMP FOUND

00:01:03.748 --> 00:01:07.051
HIMSELF RIGHT BACK WHERE HE WAS

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.418
THE DAY OF THE PARKLAND

00:01:07.185 --> 00:01:08.953
SHOOTING.

00:01:07.552 --> 00:01:11.189
SPEAK TO MY ADMINISTRATION IS

00:01:09.086 --> 00:01:12.723
GOING TO DO EVERYTHING IN OUR

00:01:11.322 --> 00:01:13.991
POWER TO DETECT OUR STUDENTS,

00:01:12.857 --> 00:01:15.193
SECURE OUR SCHOOLS AND KEEP

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:16.961
WEAPONS OUT OF THE HANDS OF

00:01:15.326 --> 00:01:19.197
THOSE WHO POSE A THREAT.

00:01:17.094 --> 00:01:20.498
EVERYONE MUST WORK TOGETHER AT

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:22.767
EVERY LEVEL OF GOVERNMENT TO

00:01:20.631 --> 00:01:23.701
KEEP OUR CHILDREN SAFE.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:26.771
&gt;&gt; Reporter: OF THE EVENT IN

00:01:23.835 --> 00:01:27.972
THE EAST ROOM WAS TO HIGHLIGHT

00:01:26.904 --> 00:01:28.506
PRESIDENT TRUMP'S SUPPORT FOR

00:01:28.105 --> 00:01:30.374
PRISON REFORM.

00:01:28.639 --> 00:01:32.777
BUT PRESIDENT TRUMP ALSO USED IT

00:01:30.508 --> 00:01:34.779
TO MAKE A SURPRISE ANNOUNCEMENT,

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:35.646
INTRODUCING MEMBERS OF HIS

00:01:34.912 --> 00:01:38.149
CABINET, THE PRESIDENT SHOCKED

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:41.686
HIS ACTING SECRETARY OF VETERANS

00:01:38.282 --> 00:01:42.220
OF PICKED OUT AFFAIRS.

00:01:41.819 --> 00:01:43.254
&gt;&gt; President Trump:

00:01:42.353 --> 00:01:45.790
SECRETARY WILKIE WHO HAS DONE A

00:01:43.387 --> 00:01:47.191
GREAT JOB AT THE VA, AND I WILL

00:01:45.923 --> 00:01:48.960
BE INFORMING HIM IN A LITTLE

00:01:47.325 --> 00:01:50.862
WHILE, HE DOESN'T KNOW THIS YET,

00:01:49.093 --> 00:01:55.533
THAT WE WILL PUT HIS NAME UP FOR

00:01:50.995 --> 00:01:56.200
NOMINATION TO BE SECRETARY OF

00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:59.370
THE VETERANS ADMINISTRATION.

00:01:56.334 --> 00:02:02.240
[APPLAUSE]

00:01:59.504 --> 00:02:02.607
I'M SORRY THAT I RUINED THE

00:02:02.373 --> 00:02:04.976
SURPRISE.

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:06.077
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WILKIE, WHO WAS

00:02:05.109 --> 00:02:08.179
SERVING AS A UNDERSECRETARY OF

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:10.548
OF DEFENSE FOR PERSONNEL AND

00:02:08.312 --> 00:02:12.183
READINESS BEFORE HE BECAME THE

00:02:10.681 --> 00:02:13.184
ACTING SECRETARY HAS A DEEP

00:02:12.316 --> 00:02:14.952
MILITARY BACKGROUND HAVING

00:02:13.317 --> 00:02:15.987
SERVED IN BOTH THE NAVY AND

00:02:15.086 --> 00:02:19.790
AIR FORCE, AND AT THE PENTAGON

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:20.258
DURING THE BUSH '43

00:02:19.924 --> 00:02:22.560
ADMINISTRATION.

00:02:20.391 --> 00:02:23.794
WE GOT A BETTER IDEA OF HOW

00:02:22.693 --> 00:02:25.663
PRESIDENT TRUMP WILL PREPARE FOR

00:02:23.928 --> 00:02:27.565
A SPECIAL INTERVIEW WITH SPECIAL

00:02:25.796 --> 00:02:29.033
COUNSEL ROBERT MUELLER.

00:02:27.698 --> 00:02:30.401
RUDY GIULIANI TELLING FOX NEWS

00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:31.202
THAT THEY WILL MIRROR DEBATE

00:02:30.535 --> 00:02:32.770
