00:02:31.335 --> 00:02:35.406
SOME SESSIONS MAY TAKE PLACE

00:02:32.904 --> 00:02:36.607
AFTER HOURS AT THE WHITE HOUSE,

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:40.378
BUT GIULIANI PREFERS WEEKENDS AT

00:02:36.741 --> 00:02:41.979
THE PRESIDENT SUMMER HOME IN

00:02:40.511 --> 00:02:43.347
BEDMINSTER, NEW JERSEY.

00:02:42.113 --> 00:02:45.416
GIULIANI IS ALSO CONSIDERING

00:02:43.481 --> 00:02:46.417
BRINGING OUTSIDE PEOPLE INTO THE

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:47.418
PROCESS INCLUDING FORMER

00:02:46.551 --> 00:02:50.388
NEW JERSEY GOVERNOR CHRIS

00:02:47.552 --> 00:02:51.188
CHRISTIE WHO ALSO HELPED WITH

00:02:50.521 --> 00:02:53.791
DEBATE PREP.

00:02:51.322 --> 00:02:54.992
AND GIULIANI TELLS FOX NEWS THAT

00:02:53.925 --> 00:02:55.993
ROBERT MUELLER HAS SIGNIFICANTLY

00:02:55.126 --> 00:02:56.994
NARROWED THE SCOOPED ON

00:02:56.127 --> 00:02:58.896
MICROSCOPE AND A NUMBER OF

00:02:57.128 --> 00:02:59.263
