00:03:04.168 --> 00:03:08.839
250 AND THE TOPICS HAVE BEEN

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:09.774
NARROWED DOWN TO RUSSIA AND THE

00:03:08.973 --> 00:03:11.576
FIRING OF JAMES COMEY.

00:03:09.907 --> 00:03:12.376
GIULIANI TELLS FOX NEWS THAT HE

00:03:11.709 --> 00:03:13.344
BELIEVES THAT THE SPECIAL

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:15.379
COUNSEL ROBERT MUELLER HAS SHOWN

00:03:13.477 --> 00:03:16.414
HE HAS ACTED IN GOOD FAITH BY

00:03:15.513 --> 00:03:18.616
WHITTLING DOWN THE QUESTIONS.

00:03:16.547 --> 00:03:20.851
AS TO WHEN THE PRESIDENT MIGHT

00:03:18.749 --> 00:03:25.756
START PREPARING, GIULIANI SAYS

00:03:20.985 --> 00:03:26.991
LIKELY NOT UNTIL AFTER THE

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.992
SUMMIT IN SOUTH KOREA BUT IF

00:03:27.124 --> 00:03:30.661
THAT IS CANCELED, HE COULD BE

00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:31.195
GETTING READY IN THE NEXT TWO OR

00:03:30.795 --> 00:03:32.129
THREE WEEKS.

00:03:31.329 --> 00:03:35.566
A DEVELOPMENT TODAY IN THE

00:03:32.263 --> 00:03:37.768
MICHAEL COHEN CASE, AN ATTORNEY

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:39.971
FILED A MOTION IN NEW YORK CITY

00:03:37.902 --> 00:03:42.239
