00:03:40.104 --> 00:03:46.744
ATTORNEY OUT OF THE CASE IN THE

00:03:42.373 --> 00:03:51.782
SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK.

00:03:46.877 --> 00:03:53.951
